The '''Guards''' are [[NPCs]] that patrol both the {{Zone|The Bastion}} and {{Zone|Cathedral}} during certain [[Faction]] quest lines.

== Locations ==
=== Mage Faction Research Questline ===
During the [[Mage Faction]] quest line, {{NPCSprite|Elle}} instructs the player with infiltrating {{Zone|The Bastion}} to steal research, during which '''Guards''' can appear at the following locations. Some of them stand still, whereas others can be seen moving between two points. Multiple  {{NPCSprite|Piglin Guard;Piglin Guards}} also appear in the area.
